  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supreme Audit Inst Tribunal Administrativo 2016-2021 - Call off Audit framework agreem. Baker Tilly</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Supreme Audit Inst Tribunal Administrativo 2016-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Objective 1.1.:
Promote the gradual improvement of the quality of service provision and increase speed
procedure in the various areas of intervention of the Administrative Court.
Strategic Objective 1.2.:
Expand the scope of the Administrative Court&apos;s action in sectors of activity
key to the development of the country.
Strategic Objective 1.3.:
Improve control of public finance management.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till uppbyggnad av riksrevisionen Tribunal Administrativo mellan &#xe5;ren 2016-2019 i Mocambique, via en givargemensam fond. Den strategiska plan PLACOR III som ligger till grund f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;det omfattar utbildning av revisorer, finansiering av revision, aktiviteter f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kad transparens, f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrat IT-system samt revidering av lagar och f&#xf6;rordningar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for consolidation of the Supreme Audit Institution, called Tribunal Administrativo, in Mozambique, via a common fund, for the years 2016 - 2919. The support is based on the strategic plan PLACOR III entailing training of auditors, financing of audit activities, activities for improved transparency, improved IT-system, and revision of laws and regulations.</narrative>
  </description>
